% HELD-OUT apparel rulings of U.S. Customs and Border Protection, run through
% the apparel model (apparel.le, which includes gri.le) after it was frozen.
%
% One scenario per ruling; each style is described by the facts the ruling
% states: the scenario names the ruling ("scenario ny_n362700 is, as stated
% in ruling NY N362700:") and each fact points at its passage ("confer "..."");
% the office's judgments say who made them ("according to CBP"). The ruling's own code is NOT
% a fact: the expectation is the six-digit subheading the model derives, and
% where it differs from the ruling's the comment says so (DISAGREES) and why.
% Selection: for each modelled heading, the two most recent rulings not used
% to write the rules whose codes (other than Chapter 98/99) all fall in
% modelled headings (none left for 6105; N341977, which cites a non-existent
% 6109.00.0012, skipped). Facts were transcribed from the text with its
% classification sentences removed. See
% README.md for the method and the results.

the target language is: prolog.
scenario facts require provenance.

the knowledge base heldout apparel cbp includes these resources:
    apparel.

the knowledge base heldout apparel cbp includes:

% Where each cited ruling is published, and a copy of its text (sources/).
ruling NY N355325 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N355325".
the text of ruling NY N355325 is at "sources/cbp/N355325.txt".
ruling NY N355025 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N355025".
the text of ruling NY N355025 is at "sources/cbp/N355025.txt".
ruling NY N352158 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N352158".
the text of ruling NY N352158 is at "sources/cbp/N352158.txt".
ruling NY N342008 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N342008".
the text of ruling NY N342008 is at "sources/cbp/N342008.txt".
ruling NY N348144 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N348144".
the text of ruling NY N348144 is at "sources/cbp/N348144.txt".
ruling NY N348143 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N348143".
the text of ruling NY N348143 is at "sources/cbp/N348143.txt".
ruling NY N355847 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N355847".
the text of ruling NY N355847 is at "sources/cbp/N355847.txt".
ruling NY N336309 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N336309".
the text of ruling NY N336309 is at "sources/cbp/N336309.txt".
ruling NY N350798 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N350798".
the text of ruling NY N350798 is at "sources/cbp/N350798.txt".
ruling NY N343173 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N343173".
the text of ruling NY N343173 is at "sources/cbp/N343173.txt".

query subheading is:
    the subheading of which good is which code.

query heading is:
    the heading of which good is which heading.

query unplaced is:
    which good is not placed by the model.

% NY N355325 (November 2025): a women's upper body garment from South Korea.
scenario ny_n355325 is, as stated in ruling NY N355325:
    style 251028A is an upper body garment,
        confer "251028A is a women’s tank-styled blouse constructed from 57 percent cotton".
    style 251028A is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style 251028A is knitted,
        confer "and 4 percent spandex knit fabric".
    the cut of style 251028A indicates women,
        confer "251028A is a women’s tank-styled blouse constructed from 57 percent cotton".
    style 251028A is loose-fitting,
        confer "The loose-fitting garment extends from the shoulders to below the waist and features".
    style 251028A is sleeveless,
        confer "shoulder straps that measure approximately two inches in width".
    style 251028A has shoulder straps,
        confer "shoulder straps that measure approximately two inches in width".
    style 251028A has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "front neckline with a three-button placket".
    style 251028A contains 57 percent of cotton,
        confer "blouse constructed from 57 percent cotton".
    style 251028A contains 39 percent of modal,
        confer "39 percent modal".
    style 251028A contains 4 percent of spandex,
        confer "and 4 percent spandex knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 251028A is 6106.10"].

% NY N355025 (November 2025): a women's knit blouse from India.
scenario ny_n355025 is, as stated in ruling NY N355025:
    % the terry blouse is style 014613.
    the terry blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "014613 is a women’s blouse constructed from 100 percent cotton terry knit fabric that measures".
    the terry blouse is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of the terry blouse is knitted,
        confer "constructed from 100 percent cotton terry knit fabric that measures at least 10 or more stitches per linear centimeter".
    the cut of the terry blouse indicates women,
        confer "014613 is a women’s blouse constructed from 100 percent cotton terry knit fabric that measures at least 10 or more stitches per".
    the terry blouse is loose-fitting,
        confer "The loose-fitting garment extends from the shoulders to below the waist and features".
    the fabric of the terry blouse is terry,
        confer "constructed from 100 percent cotton terry knit fabric that measures at least 10 or more stitches per linear".
    the terry blouse contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "blouse constructed from 100 percent cotton terry knit fabric that measures".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the terry blouse is 6106.10"].

% NY N352158 (September 2025): a men's T-shirt from Haiti.
scenario ny_n352158 is, as stated in ruling NY N352158:
    style PCTBD542025 is an upper body garment,
        confer "PCTBD542025 is a men’s T-shirt constructed from lightweight".
    style PCTBD542025 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style PCTBD542025 is knitted,
        confer "100% cotton jersey knit fabric".
    the cut of style PCTBD542025 indicates men,
        confer "PCTBD542025 is a men’s T-shirt constructed from lightweight".
    the fabric of style PCTBD542025 is lightweight,
        confer "PCTBD542025 is a men’s T-shirt constructed from lightweight".
    style PCTBD542025 is of plain knit fabric,
        confer "100% cotton jersey knit fabric".
    style PCTBD542025 contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "100% cotton jersey knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style PCTBD542025 is 6109.10"].

% NY N342008 (August 2024): a woman's reversible tank top from Taiwan.
scenario ny_n342008 is, as stated in ruling NY N342008:
    % the reversible tank top is style 018085.
    the reversible tank top is an upper body garment,
        confer "018085 is a woman’s reversible tank top composed of 80 percent nylon and 20 percent spandex knit fabric".
    the reversible tank top is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of the reversible tank top is knitted,
        confer "percent nylon and 20 percent spandex knit fabric".
    the cut of the reversible tank top indicates women,
        confer "018085 is a woman’s reversible tank top composed of 80 percent nylon and 20 percent spandex knit fabric".
    the reversible tank top is sleeveless,
        confer "The sleeveless garment features a racer back style with a scooped front neckline".
    the reversible tank top has shoulder straps,
        confer "shoulder straps that measure 1¼ inch wide".
    the rear neckline of the reversible tank top falls below the nape of the neck,
        confer "a rear neckline that falls below the nape of the neck".
    the reversible tank top contains 80 percent of nylon,
        confer "reversible tank top composed of 80 percent nylon and 20 percent spandex knit fabric".
    the reversible tank top contains 20 percent of spandex,
        confer "of 80 percent nylon and 20 percent spandex knit fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the reversible tank top is 6109.90"].

% NY N348144 (January 2026): a women's knit sweater from Cambodia.
scenario ny_n348144 is, as stated in ruling NY N348144:
    style 239752 is an upper body garment,
        confer "239752 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 50 percent cotton".
    style 239752 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style 239752 is knitted,
        confer "239752 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 50 percent cotton".
    the cut of style 239752 indicates women,
        confer "239752 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 50 percent cotton".
    style 239752 contains 47.7 percent of cotton,
        confer "47.7 percent cotton".
    style 239752 contains 31.3 percent of polyester,
        confer "31.3 percent polyester".
    style 239752 contains 13.7 percent of nylon,
        confer "13.7 percent nylon".
    style 239752 contains 6.6 percent of elastane,
        confer "6.6 percent elastane".
    style 239752 contains 0.7 percent of metalized yarn.
    all the yarn of style 239752 is metalized yarn,
        according to the CBP laboratory, confer "with all plies twisted together",
        because "the garment is knitted from a single eight-ply yarn with all plies, two of them metallic, twisted together".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 239752 is 6110.90"].

% NY N348143 (January 2026): a women's knit sweater from Cambodia.
scenario ny_n348143 is, as stated in ruling NY N348143:
    style 239375 is an upper body garment,
        confer "239375 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 71 percent polyester".
    style 239375 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style 239375 is knitted,
        confer "239375 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 71 percent polyester".
    the cut of style 239375 indicates women,
        confer "239375 is a women’s knit sweater stated to be constructed from 71 percent polyester".
    style 239375 contains 73.3 percent of polyester,
        confer "73.3 polyester".
    style 239375 contains 16.7 percent of wool,
        confer "16.7 percent wool".
    style 239375 contains 8.6 percent of metalized yarn,
        confer "8.6 metallic".
    style 239375 contains 1.4 percent of elastane,
        confer "and 1.4 percent elastane".
    all the yarn of style 239375 is metalized yarn,
        according to the CBP laboratory, confer "with all plies twisted together",
        because "the garment is knitted from a single ten-ply yarn with all plies, three of them metallic, twisted together".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 239375 is 6110.90"].

% NY N355847 (November 2025): a men's shirt from Nicaragua.
scenario ny_n355847 is, as stated in ruling NY N355847:
    style 334171 is an upper body garment,
        confer "334171 is a men’s shirt constructed from 100% cotton".
    style 334171 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style 334171 is woven,
        confer "woven flannel fabric".
    the cut of style 334171 indicates men,
        confer "334171 is a men’s shirt constructed from 100% cotton".
    style 334171 has a collar,
        confer "The garment features a button-down collar".
    style 334171 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "a partial front opening with two functional button closures (one on the collar and the other".
    style 334171 contains 100 percent of cotton,
        confer "334171 is a men’s shirt constructed from 100% cotton".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style 334171 is 6205.20"].

% NY N336309 (May 2024): a men's shirt from Guatemala.
scenario ny_n336309 is, as stated in ruling NY N336309:
    % DISAGREES: CBP gives 6205.20; the model gives 6205.30 — CBP classifies on the stated composition (98% cotton, 2% spandex) while its own laboratory, testing the fabric for the short-supply claim, reports 96% polyester and 4% spandex; the transcription takes the laboratory's finding.
    style PE001 is an upper body garment,
        confer "PE001 is a men’s shirt stated to be constructed from 98% cotton and 2% spandex woven fabric".
    style PE001 is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style PE001 is woven,
        confer "PE001 is a men’s shirt stated to be constructed from 98% cotton and 2% spandex woven fabric".
    the cut of style PE001 indicates men,
        confer "PE001 is a men’s shirt stated to be constructed from 98% cotton and 2% spandex woven fabric".
    style PE001 has a collar,
        confer "The garment features a self-fabric button-down collar".
    style PE001 has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "full front opening with seven button closures".
    style PE001 closes left over right,
        confer "a left-over-right".
    style PE001 contains 96 percent of polyester,
        according to the CBP laboratory, confer "garment is constructed of 96% polyester and 4% spandex woven fabric that conforms",
        because "the laboratory found the fabric to be 96% polyester and 4% spandex, not the stated 98% cotton and 2% spandex".
    style PE001 contains 4 percent of spandex,
        according to the CBP laboratory, confer "constructed of 96% polyester and 4% spandex woven fabric that conforms to all of",
        because "the laboratory found the fabric to be 96% polyester and 4% spandex, not the stated 98% cotton and 2% spandex".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of style PE001 is 6205.30"].

% NY N350798 (July 2025): a woman's scrub top from El Salvador.
scenario ny_n350798 is, as stated in ruling NY N350798:
    % DISAGREES: CBP gives 6206.40; the model gives no heading — a pullover woven top with a V-neckline, no opening and no fit recorded: neither a shirt nor a blouse of Note 4 to Chapter 62 (the blouse gap of the in-sample rulings).
    style AFMT04CAS is an upper body garment,
        confer "AFMT04CAS is a woman’s scrub top constructed from 90% polyester and 10% spandex woven fabric".
    style AFMT04CAS is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of style AFMT04CAS is woven,
        confer "AFMT04CAS is a woman’s scrub top constructed from 90% polyester and 10% spandex woven fabric".
    the cut of style AFMT04CAS indicates women,
        confer "AFMT04CAS is a woman’s scrub top constructed from 90% polyester and 10% spandex woven fabric".
    style AFMT04CAS contains 90 percent of polyester,
        confer "scrub top constructed from 90% polyester and 10% spandex woven fabric".
    style AFMT04CAS contains 10 percent of spandex,
        confer "constructed from 90% polyester and 10% spandex woven fabric".
    subheading expects answers [].
    unplaced expects answers ["style AFMT04CAS is not placed by the model"].

% NY N343173 (October 2024): a woman's blouse from China.
scenario ny_n343173 is, as stated in ruling NY N343173:
    % the wrap blouse is style C-RAZY/A167200IKAP.
    the wrap blouse is an upper body garment,
        confer "C-RAZY/A167200IKAP is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% viscose woven fabric".
    the wrap blouse is classified under the US tariff,
        confer "Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS)".
    the fabric construction of the wrap blouse is woven,
        confer "C-RAZY/A167200IKAP is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% viscose woven fabric".
    the cut of the wrap blouse indicates women,
        confer "C-RAZY/A167200IKAP is a woman’s blouse constructed from 100% viscose woven fabric".
    the wrap blouse has a collar,
        confer "The wrap-style blouse features a collar with a V-neckline".
    the wrap blouse has an opening starting at the neckline,
        confer "and a wrap-style front opening secured at the waist by a self-fabric tie".
    the wrap blouse contains 100 percent of viscose,
        confer "blouse constructed from 100% viscose woven fabric".
    subheading expects answers ["the subheading of the wrap blouse is 6206.40"].
